1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,966
Kedarnath ka mandir, 400 saal barf ke neeche daba raha?

2
00:00:04,966 --> 00:00:10,429
Kuch vaigyanik yahi kehte hain. Aur phir bhi mandir khada raha,

3
00:00:10,429 --> 00:00:11,919
seedha aur majboot.

4
00:00:11,919 --> 00:00:14,327
Lekin kahani yahin khatam nahi hoti.

5
00:00:14,327 --> 00:00:18,339
2013 mein pahad se paani aur pattharon ka sailaab utra.

6
00:00:18,339 --> 00:00:22,352
Poori ghaati mein tabahi machi, ghar aur dukaanein beh gayi.

7
00:00:22,352 --> 00:00:26,208
Par mandir? Mandir ke peeche ek vishaal patthar aakar ruk gaya.

8
00:00:26,208 --> 00:00:28,662
Aur paani do hisson mein bant gaya,

9
00:00:28,662 --> 00:00:31,116
mandir ke dono taraf se nikal gaya.

10
00:00:31,116 --> 00:00:33,938
Log is patthar ko Bhim Shila kehte hain.

11
00:00:33,938 --> 00:00:37,112
Unka vishwas hai ki Bhim ne khud ise rakha.

12
00:00:37,112 --> 00:00:39,581
Vigyan iske baare mein kya kehta hai?

13
00:00:39,581 --> 00:00:43,273
Is video mein teen nahi, bas yeh sawaal hain.

14
00:00:43,273 --> 00:00:47,786
Mandir kisne banaya? Kya sach mein barf ke neeche daba tha?

15
00:00:47,786 --> 00:00:50,248
Aur 2013 mein woh bacha kaise?

16
00:00:50,248 --> 00:00:52,407
Har jawab ke saath sabut hoga,

17
00:00:52,407 --> 00:00:56,365
aur har sabut ke saath uska source. Par shuruaat wahan se,

18
00:00:56,365 --> 00:00:59,244
jahan se Kedarnath ki katha shuru hoti hai.

19
00:00:59,244 --> 00:01:03,405
Mahabharat ka yudh khatam ho chuka tha. Kurukshetra mein Pandav jeete,

20
00:01:03,405 --> 00:01:07,944
par apne hi bhaiyon aur gurujanon ka khoon unke haath par tha.

21
00:01:07,944 --> 00:01:09,828
Garhwal ki lok-katha kehti hai,

22
00:01:09,828 --> 00:01:12,466
ise gotra hatya ka paap maana gaya.

23
00:01:12,466 --> 00:01:16,235
Gotra hatya yaani apne hi kul ke logon ko maarna.

24
00:01:16,235 --> 00:01:19,530
Is paap se mukti kaun dila sakta tha?

25
00:01:19,530 --> 00:01:22,001
Pandavon ko jawab mila, sirf Shiv.

26
00:01:22,001 --> 00:01:26,120
Aur Shiv ki talaash unhe Himalaya ki ore le chali.

27
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:27,758
Lekin katha mein twist hai.

28
00:01:27,758 --> 00:01:31,033
Shiv Pandavon se milna hi nahi chahte the. Kehte hain,

29
00:01:31,033 --> 00:01:34,309
woh ek bail ka roop lekar pahadon mein chhup gaye.

30
00:01:34,309 --> 00:01:38,323
Bhim ne bail ko pehchaan liya. Woh use pakadne daude.

31
00:01:38,323 --> 00:01:40,732
Par bail dharti mein samaane laga,

32
00:01:40,732 --> 00:01:43,542
aur sirf uski peeth upar reh gayi.

33
00:01:43,542 --> 00:01:44,642
Bhakt maante hain,

34
00:01:44,642 --> 00:01:47,942
Kedarnath mein jo trikon jaisa patthar pooja jaata hai,

35
00:01:47,942 --> 00:01:49,409
woh wahi peeth hai.

36
00:01:49,409 --> 00:01:53,076
Isliye yahan ka shivling baaki jagahon se alag dikhta hai.

37
00:01:53,076 --> 00:01:56,972
Lok-katha kehti hai, phir Pandavon ne yahan pehla mandir banaya.

38
00:01:56,972 --> 00:01:59,700
Uske baad woh Swargarohini ki ore chale,

39
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:03,986
yaani woh pahad jahan se swarg ka raasta maana jaata hai.

40
00:02:03,986 --> 00:02:07,619
Yeh katha hai, aur iska koi likhit sabut nahi milta.

41
00:02:07,619 --> 00:02:10,162
Par asli sawaal ab shuru hota hai.

42
00:02:10,162 --> 00:02:12,705
Jo patthar ka mandir aaj khada hai,

43
00:02:12,705 --> 00:02:14,885
uske saath sadiyon tak kya hua?

44
00:02:14,885 --> 00:02:19,343
Mandir ke theek peeche ek glacier hai, naam hai Chorabari.

45
00:02:19,343 --> 00:02:22,464
Glacier yaani barf ki ek badi nadi,

46
00:02:22,464 --> 00:02:26,030
jo saal dar saal bahut dheere khisakti hai.

47
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:26,745
Ab socho,

48
00:02:26,745 --> 00:02:31,037
kya kabhi yeh glacier aage badh kar mandir tak pahunch gaya tha?

49
00:02:31,037 --> 00:02:34,614
Ek vaigyanik ne yahi sawaal poocha, aur jawab dhoondhne nikle.

50
00:02:34,614 --> 00:02:35,719
Dr. R. K.

51
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:39,401
Chaujar ne Kedarnath ke aas-paas ke pattharon ka adhyayan kiya.

52
00:02:39,401 --> 00:02:43,083
Unka paper Current Science naam ki science patrika mein chhapa.

53
00:02:43,083 --> 00:02:45,286
Unka tareeka bada anokha tha.

54
00:02:45,286 --> 00:02:48,812
Pattharon par ek patli si parat ugti hai,

55
00:02:48,812 --> 00:02:52,778
jise lichen kehte hain. Kai jaisi, hare-peele rang ki.

56
00:02:52,778 --> 00:02:56,461
Lichen bahut dheere badhta hai, saal mein bas thoda sa.

57
00:02:56,461 --> 00:02:59,407
Toh uska size naap kar pata chalta hai,

58
00:02:59,407 --> 00:03:02,353
patthar kitne samay se khule mein pada hai.

59
00:03:02,353 --> 00:03:05,156
Jahan barf thi, wahan lichen nahi ug sakta.

60
00:03:05,156 --> 00:03:09,009
Barf hatne ke baad hi uski ghadi chalni shuru hoti hai.

61
00:03:09,009 --> 00:03:10,761
Yahi tha Chaujar ka sabut.

62
00:03:10,761 --> 00:03:11,973
Unhone moraine dekhe.

63
00:03:11,973 --> 00:03:17,226
Moraine yaani glacier ke saath bahkar aaye patthar aur mitti ke lambe dher,

64
00:03:17,226 --> 00:03:20,459
jo barf pighalne par peeche chhoot jaate hain.

65
00:03:20,459 --> 00:03:24,429
Ab aata hai woh daur jise Little Ice Age kehte hain.

66
00:03:24,429 --> 00:03:28,038
Yaani kuch sadiyan jab duniya ka mausam thanda ho gaya,

67
00:03:28,038 --> 00:03:29,482
aur glacier aage badhe.

68
00:03:29,482 --> 00:03:31,307
Chaujar ke andaaze se,

69
00:03:31,307 --> 00:03:37,694
isi thande daur mein Kedarnath mandir lagbhag 400 saal barf ke neeche daba raha.

70
00:03:37,694 --> 00:03:41,800
Socho, itni lambi thand, aur mandir phir bhi khada!

71
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,763
Lekin ek paper kaafi nahi hota.

72
00:03:43,763 --> 00:03:46,380
Agar barf sach mein mandir par se guzri,

73
00:03:46,380 --> 00:03:49,979
toh pattharon par uske nishaan bhi hone chahiye. Kya woh mile?

74
00:03:49,979 --> 00:03:55,778
2013 ke baad Dehradun ke Wadia Institute of Himalayan Geology ke vaigyanik Kedarnath pahunche.

75
00:03:55,778 --> 00:03:59,506
Yeh sanstha Himalaya ke pahadon ki padhai karti hai.

76
00:03:59,506 --> 00:04:02,986
Unhone mandir ki bahar ki deewaron ko kareeb se dekha.

77
00:04:02,986 --> 00:04:07,161
Granite ke bhaari pattharon par unhe peele rang ki lambi lakeerein dikhi.

78
00:04:07,161 --> 00:04:10,674
Inhe striation kehte hain. Yaani kharonch ki lakeerein,

79
00:04:10,674 --> 00:04:16,823
jo tab banti hain jab barf aur usme phanse kankad patthar par ghisatte hain.

80
00:04:16,823 --> 00:04:20,621
Saath mein kuch jagah patthar chikna, polish jaisa ho gaya tha.

81
00:04:20,621 --> 00:04:23,383
Jaise kisi ne sadiyon tak regmaal ghisa ho.

82
00:04:23,383 --> 00:04:25,454
Yeh kaam khisakti barf karti hai.

83
00:04:25,454 --> 00:04:27,717
Wadia Institute ke vaigyanikon ke mutabik,

84
00:04:27,717 --> 00:04:29,979
yeh nishaan kai sadiyon mein bane.

85
00:04:29,979 --> 00:04:34,882
Matlab barf ne kisi na kisi roop mein in pattharon ko chhua tha.

86
00:04:34,882 --> 00:04:38,057
Toh jo mandir sadiyon ki barf jhel gaya,

87
00:04:38,057 --> 00:04:41,232
kya woh ek raat ka paani jhel paata?

88
00:04:41,232 --> 00:04:43,217
Yahi imtihaan 2013 mein aaya.

89
00:04:43,217 --> 00:04:47,898
June ka mahina tha. Kedarnath mein yatra chal rahi thi,

90
00:04:47,898 --> 00:04:51,174
ghaati yatriyon aur dukaanon se bhari thi.

91
00:04:51,174 --> 00:04:53,983
Tabhi aasmaan khul ke barasne laga.

92
00:04:53,983 --> 00:04:57,981
Chorabari glacier ke paas Wadia Institute ka ek camp tha.

93
00:04:57,981 --> 00:05:02,380
Wahan baarish naapne ki machine lagi thi. Usne jo record kiya,

94
00:05:02,380 --> 00:05:03,579
woh daraavna tha.

95
00:05:03,579 --> 00:05:08,017
Sirf 24 ghante ke andar, 325 millimetre baarish ho gayi.

96
00:05:08,017 --> 00:05:10,236
Yeh aam barsaat nahi thi.

97
00:05:10,236 --> 00:05:13,343
Yeh aasmaan se girti hui nadi thi.

98
00:05:13,343 --> 00:05:14,870
Itna paani gaya kahan?

99
00:05:14,870 --> 00:05:17,925
Pahad ki dhalaan par barf pighal rahi thi,

100
00:05:17,925 --> 00:05:19,452
naale ufan rahe the.

101
00:05:19,452 --> 00:05:22,507
Aur upar ek jheel chupchaap bhar rahi thi.

102
00:05:22,507 --> 00:05:25,743
Is jheel ka naam tha Chorabari jheel.

103
00:05:25,743 --> 00:05:30,366
Iski deewar kisi insaan ne nahi banayi thi. Woh moraine,

104
00:05:30,366 --> 00:05:33,602
yaani patthar-mitti ke dher se bani thi.

105
00:05:33,602 --> 00:05:36,515
Mitti ki deewar, aur peeche lagaataar badhta paani.

106
00:05:36,515 --> 00:05:40,155
Ab sawaal sirf yeh tha, yeh deewar kab tak tikegi?

107
00:05:40,155 --> 00:05:44,524
Kisi ko andaaza nahi tha ki jawab kuch hi ghanton mein milega.

108
00:05:44,524 --> 00:05:48,041
Agli subah. Mandir se lagbhag 2 kilometre upar,

109
00:05:48,041 --> 00:05:51,558
Chorabari jheel ki kachchi deewar achanak toot gayi.

110
00:05:51,558 --> 00:05:55,954
Jo paani jama hua tha, woh ek saath neeche bhaga.

111
00:05:55,954 --> 00:05:59,602
Wadia Institute ke chowkidaron ne baad mein bataya, unhone kya dekha.

112
00:05:59,602 --> 00:06:03,250
Poori jheel 10 minute se bhi kam mein khaali ho gayi.

113
00:06:03,250 --> 00:06:06,706
Socho, ek poori jheel, 10 minute se kam mein.

114
00:06:06,706 --> 00:06:10,929
Aur woh paani akela nahi aaya. Saath mein bade bade patthar,

115
00:06:10,929 --> 00:06:13,617
mitti aur ped bhi beh rahe the.

116
00:06:13,617 --> 00:06:17,685
Neeche Kedarnath ka bazaar tha, dharamshalayein thi, yatri the.

117
00:06:17,685 --> 00:06:21,300
Paani aur malbe ke saamne kuch nahi tika.

118
00:06:21,300 --> 00:06:24,916
Kitne hi parivaar hamesha ke liye bichhad gaye.

119
00:06:24,916 --> 00:06:29,987
Aur yeh sailaab seedha us raaste par tha jahan mandir khada tha.

120
00:06:29,987 --> 00:06:34,636
Mandir ki peeth, yaani uski uttar wali deewar, theek saamne thi.

121
00:06:34,636 --> 00:06:38,031
Toh mandir ko kuch hona chahiye tha, hai na?

122
00:06:38,031 --> 00:06:41,427
Par jab paani utra, toh log hairaan reh gaye.

123
00:06:41,427 --> 00:06:42,936
Mandir wahi khada tha.

124
00:06:42,936 --> 00:06:46,158
Mandir ke peeche ek vishaal patthar pada tha.

125
00:06:46,158 --> 00:06:48,574
Yeh patthar pehle wahan nahi tha.

126
00:06:48,574 --> 00:06:52,199
Ise sailaab khud bahakar laaya tha, upar pahad se.

127
00:06:52,199 --> 00:06:54,567
Archaeological Survey of India, yaani ASI,

128
00:06:54,567 --> 00:06:57,723
desh ki purani imaaraton ki dekhbhaal karti hai.

129
00:06:57,723 --> 00:07:02,064
Uske mutabik yeh patthar mandir se lagbhag 9 metre peeche ruka.

130
00:07:02,064 --> 00:07:06,672
9 metre, yaani lagbhag ek bade kamre jitni doori.

131
00:07:06,672 --> 00:07:10,769
Itne bade patthar ka, itne tez paani mein,

132
00:07:10,769 --> 00:07:13,329
theek wahan ruk jaana. Kaise?

133
00:07:13,329 --> 00:07:15,087
Ab asli kamaal dekhiye.

134
00:07:15,087 --> 00:07:19,921
ASI ke mutabik is patthar ne ek dhaal ka kaam kiya.

135
00:07:19,921 --> 00:07:23,436
Paani aur malba seedha mandir se nahi takraya.

136
00:07:23,436 --> 00:07:26,446
Patthar ne sailaab ko do hisson mein baant diya.

137
00:07:26,446 --> 00:07:29,791
Ek dhaara mandir ke baayein se nikli, doosri daayein se.

138
00:07:29,791 --> 00:07:31,463
Beech mein mandir bacha raha.

139
00:07:31,463 --> 00:07:35,020
Jaise nadi ke beech pada patthar paani ko kaat deta hai,

140
00:07:35,020 --> 00:07:37,607
waise hi. Bas yahan nadi paani ki nahi,

141
00:07:37,607 --> 00:07:39,224
pattharon aur malbe ki thi.

142
00:07:39,224 --> 00:07:42,974
Pujariyon aur bhakton ne is patthar ko naam diya, Bhim Shila.

143
00:07:42,974 --> 00:07:48,088
Unka vishwas hai ki Bhim ne Shiv ke dham ki raksha ke liye ise rakha.

144
00:07:48,088 --> 00:07:51,755
Ek taraf vishwas, ek taraf ASI ki report.

145
00:07:51,755 --> 00:07:55,422
Dono ek hi patthar ki baat karte hain.

146
00:07:55,422 --> 00:08:00,464
Lekin ek aur sawaal baaki hai. Kya sirf patthar kaafi tha?

147
00:08:00,464 --> 00:08:03,944
Paani ne mandir ke dono taraf se zor maara hoga.

148
00:08:03,944 --> 00:08:06,033
Phir bhi deewarein kyun nahi giri?

149
00:08:06,033 --> 00:08:09,165
Jawab mandir ke pattharon ki banawat mein chhupa hai.

150
00:08:09,165 --> 00:08:11,203
ASI ki jaanch mein pata chala,

151
00:08:11,203 --> 00:08:13,580
is mandir mein mortar laga hi nahi.

152
00:08:13,580 --> 00:08:17,996
Mortar yaani cement ya choone ka woh masala jo pattharon ko jodta hai.

153
00:08:17,996 --> 00:08:21,479
Yahan bhaari pattharon ko kaat kar, ek ke upar ek,

154
00:08:21,479 --> 00:08:23,569
puzzle ki tarah fit kiya gaya.

155
00:08:23,569 --> 00:08:26,007
Har patthar doosre mein phansa hua hai.

156
00:08:26,007 --> 00:08:29,240
Aur jodon par lohe ki patti jaisi pakad lagi hai,

157
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:32,474
jise clamp kehte hain. Yeh pattharon ko khisakne nahi deti.

158
00:08:32,474 --> 00:08:34,414
Patthar hilte hain, par bikharte nahi.

159
00:08:34,414 --> 00:08:35,549
ASI ke mutabik,

160
00:08:35,549 --> 00:08:40,844
isi banawat ki wajah se mandir bhookamp ke jhatke aur paani ka bhaari dabaav,

161
00:08:40,844 --> 00:08:44,247
dono jhel sakta hai. Dhaanche mein lachila-pan bhi hai,

162
00:08:44,247 --> 00:08:45,382
aur taakat bhi.

163
00:08:45,382 --> 00:08:48,035
Toh barf ke nishaan bhi, Bhim Shila bhi,

164
00:08:48,035 --> 00:08:50,687
aur majboot banawat bhi. Sab saaf lagta hai.

165
00:08:50,687 --> 00:08:54,335
Par yahan twist hai. Vaigyanik khud ek doosre se sehmat nahi.

166
00:08:54,335 --> 00:08:56,724
Pehla jhagda barf ko lekar hai.

167
00:08:56,724 --> 00:09:00,706
Kya mandir sach mein khisakte glacier ke andar dafan tha?

168
00:09:00,706 --> 00:09:03,095
Ya barf bas aas-paas jama thi?

169
00:09:03,095 --> 00:09:07,117
Ek paksh kehta hai, glacier mandir ke upar se guzra,

170
00:09:07,117 --> 00:09:09,933
isliye deewaron par kharonch ke nishaan hain.

171
00:09:09,933 --> 00:09:13,151
Yahi baat Wadia Institute ki team ne kahi.

172
00:09:13,151 --> 00:09:14,861
Doosra paksh kehta hai,

173
00:09:14,861 --> 00:09:19,562
shayad moraine ke dher bas mandir ke charon taraf jama hue.

174
00:09:19,562 --> 00:09:23,836
Aur upar se barf girti rahi, chhat tak dhak gayi.

175
00:09:23,836 --> 00:09:24,963
Sabse dilchasp baat?

176
00:09:24,963 --> 00:09:28,719
Chaujar ka apna paper bhi koi ek jawab nahi chunta.

177
00:09:28,719 --> 00:09:32,851
Woh 3 alag sambhavnayein saamne rakhta hai, aur faisla nahi karta.

178
00:09:32,851 --> 00:09:36,700
Shayad mandir glacier ke aane se pehle hi ban gaya tha.

179
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:40,550
Ya shayad barf aakar laut gayi, aur mandir uske baad bana.

180
00:09:40,550 --> 00:09:41,304
Ya phir,

181
00:09:41,304 --> 00:09:45,452
kisi tarah mandir glacier ke beech ya uske kinare par bana.

182
00:09:45,452 --> 00:09:46,583
Paper kehta hai,

183
00:09:46,583 --> 00:09:49,977
abhi koi bhi pakke taur par nahi keh sakta.

184
00:09:49,977 --> 00:09:52,588
Doosra jhagda aur bhi bada hai.

185
00:09:52,588 --> 00:09:55,635
Aaj ka patthar ka mandir banwaya kisne?

186
00:09:55,635 --> 00:09:58,682
Ek paksh kehta hai Adi Shankaracharya ne,

187
00:09:58,682 --> 00:10:01,293
doosra kehta hai Raja Bhoj ne.

188
00:10:01,293 --> 00:10:03,669
Dono ke beech sadiyon ka farq hai,

189
00:10:03,669 --> 00:10:06,385
aur pakka likhit sabut kisi ke paas nahi.

190
00:10:06,385 --> 00:10:09,779
Toh mandir ki asli umar bhi ab tak rahasya hai.

191
00:10:09,779 --> 00:10:10,953
Aur Bhim Shila?

192
00:10:10,953 --> 00:10:16,043
Itne tez sailaab mein woh patthar theek mandir ke peeche hi kyun ruka?

193
00:10:16,043 --> 00:10:19,566
Vaigyanik iska poora hisaab abhi tak nahi laga paaye.

194
00:10:19,566 --> 00:10:22,303
Kya zameen ki dhalaan ne use roka?

195
00:10:22,303 --> 00:10:25,432
Ya kisi aur patthar se takra kar atka?

196
00:10:25,432 --> 00:10:28,560
Har jawab ek andaaza hai, pakka sabut nahi.

197
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:31,525
Toh jo cheez sabse pakki lagti thi,

198
00:10:31,525 --> 00:10:34,067
wahi sabse bada sawaal ban gayi.

199
00:10:34,067 --> 00:10:38,727
Lekin yeh sab aap khud apni aankhon se dekh sakte hain.

200
00:10:38,727 --> 00:10:42,196
Kedarnath aaj bhi khada hai, Mandakini ghaati ke upar,

201
00:10:42,196 --> 00:10:44,123
barf ke pahadon ke beech.

202
00:10:44,123 --> 00:10:48,363
Yatra ke mausam mein yahan bhakton ki lambi qatarein lagti hain.

203
00:10:48,363 --> 00:10:52,403
Mandir ke peeche jaiye. Wahan Bhim Shila aaj bhi padi hai.

204
00:10:52,403 --> 00:10:55,709
Log is par tilak lagate hain, haath jodte hain,

205
00:10:55,709 --> 00:10:57,178
aur tasveerein lete hain.

206
00:10:57,178 --> 00:11:00,357
Mandir ki bahar ki deewaron ko dhyaan se dekhiye.

207
00:11:00,357 --> 00:11:02,830
Granite ke pattharon par peeli lakeerein dhoondhiye.

208
00:11:02,830 --> 00:11:06,009
Inhe hi barf ke purane nishaan maana jaata hai.

209
00:11:06,009 --> 00:11:09,768
Pattharon ke jod bhi dekhiye. Kahin cement nahi milega,

210
00:11:09,768 --> 00:11:11,439
bas kase hue patthar.

211
00:11:11,439 --> 00:11:15,198
Yahi woh banawat hai jo sailaab ke saamne tiki.

212
00:11:15,198 --> 00:11:18,029
Aur upar Chorabari glacier ki taraf dekhiye.

213
00:11:18,029 --> 00:11:20,861
Wahi jagah jahan se sab shuru hua,

214
00:11:20,861 --> 00:11:24,501
aur jahan ki barf kabhi neeche tak aayi thi.

215
00:11:24,501 --> 00:11:26,179
Toh wapas wahi sawaal.

216
00:11:26,179 --> 00:11:30,376
Kya Kedarnath mandir 400 saal barf ke neeche daba raha?

217
00:11:30,376 --> 00:11:32,474
Kuch sabut haan kehte hain,

218
00:11:32,474 --> 00:11:35,411
kuch vaigyanik abhi bhi soch rahe hain.

219
00:11:35,411 --> 00:11:40,379
Aur 2013 mein woh kaise bacha? Ek patthar, ek majboot banawat,

220
00:11:40,379 --> 00:11:43,541
aur bhakton ke liye Bhim ka aashirwad.

221
00:11:43,541 --> 00:11:46,702
Har kisi ke paas apna jawab hai.

222
00:11:46,702 --> 00:11:50,154
Agle video mein chalenge ek aur rahasya ki ore,

223
00:11:50,154 --> 00:11:52,071
samundar ke neeche doobi Dwarka.

224
00:11:52,071 --> 00:11:55,523
Wahan bhi sabut aur katha aamne saamne khade hain.

225
00:11:55,523 --> 00:12:00,904
Ab aapse sawaal. Kya aap kabhi Kedarnath gaye hain,

226
00:12:00,904 --> 00:12:05,687
aur Bhim Shila dekhi hai? Comment mein batayiye,

227
00:12:05,687 --> 00:12:11,666
aur us dost ko bhejo jo Kedarnath jaane wala hai.
